About 270 spoken words (262 without the optional line). Times assume about 150 words a minute plus the click beats. Tags in the cues show which requirement each beat proves: **W1 to W5** are Winstead's five, **NMC** is NMC², **NV** is NVIDIA, **ST** is Spacetime.

**0:00 · Hook**
[DEMO: Screen A, Overview. The 3D data center turns slowly, every rack green. Hands off the trackpad.]
> It's 2 a.m. Ransomware has the file share, the phones are down, and the attacker is reading your email. *(Optional, cut if behind:)* CISA has documented attackers joining their victims' incident calls. You don't investigate in front of the suspect.

**0:14 · Reveal and honesty** (W1)
[DEMO: point at the Claura mark, then at the corner label "Simulated attack · live software".]
> This is Claura, the immune system for AI data centers. Its command center runs outside the network it defends. The attack is a replay; the software is live.

**0:25 · The breach** (NMC: the missed warning)
[DEMO: the Driver clicks the amber rack in Hall B; host b14-gpu-07 opens. Click Open incident: the attack path lights from vm-7f3a to the host and its eleven neighbors.]
> One customer's AI workload is breaking out of its virtual machine, toward a server it shares with eleven other companies. Six warnings in six tools; none says "incident."

**0:38 · The agents** (NV)
[DEMO: Agents view, the live tool-call trace. Point at the tag "nemotron-3-nano:4b · local" and at Triage's `get_host_inventory` and `check_reachability` rows.]
> Our agents run NVIDIA Nemotron on-prem, calling tools step by step. Sentry correlates the six signals and opens the incident. Triage checks inventory and reachability: one host, eleven neighbors. Warden proposes containment, reversible steps first.

**0:52 · Policy and the one human step** (ST, NV, NMC: right information at the right time)
[DEMO: point at the policy column: auto / needs approval / denied. Point at the red row "reimage_host · denied · red-team probe". The approval sheet slides up: touch Evidence, Scope, Rollback, then press ⌘↵. Screen B flips to Contained at the same moment.]
> Every proposal hits a policy gate inside a SpacetimeDB reducer. Policy, not the model, decides. Our red-team probe tried to reimage the host: denied. Quarantine needs a human: evidence, scope, rollback, one card.
